{"title": "无标题", "index": 101, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body>\n<p class=\"center\">\n<span class=\"bold\">认准读客熊猫</span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"bodyContent\">读客所有图书，在书脊、腰封、封底和前后勒口都有“<span class=\"bold\">读客熊猫</span>\r\n ”标志。</p>\n<p class=\"center\">\n<span class=\"bold\">两步帮你快速找到读客图书</span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"bodyContent\">\n<span class=\"bold\">1、找读客熊猫</span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"bodyPic\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"Image00021.jpg\" width=\"20%\"/>\n</p>\n<p class=\"bodyContent\">\n<span class=\"bold\">2、找黑白格子</span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"bodyPic\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"Image00022.jpg\" width=\"42%\"/>\n</p>\n<p class=\"bodyPic\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"Image00023.jpg\" width=\"95%\"/>\n</p>\n</body>"}]}